BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:r-family-volunteer-day-20261121@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261113T201106Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T113000
SUMMARY:Family volunteer day · Activate Good
LOCATION:Venture Hall at Marbles IMAX (Marbles Kids Museum campus)\, Marble
 s Kids Museum campus\, downtown Raleigh\, NC
DESCRIPTION:Kid-friendly service projects for families from across the Tria
 ngle\, held indoors. There are two shifts: 10–11:30 AM and 12:30–2 PM.
 \n\nHow to join: A parent or caregiver registers the whole family for one 
 shift through the registration link on the Family Volunteer Day page. Spac
 e is limited. You can also bring newborn or size 1 diapers\, baby wipes\, 
 or new or gently read children's books for the collection drives.\n\nBefor
 e you go: Meant for families with children. Marbles doesn't provide free p
 arking\, but city-owned decks are free the morning of the parade.\n\nhttps
 ://activategood.org/family-volunteer-day/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week
 .
URL:https://activategood.org/family-volunteer-day/
END:VEVENT
